==============================================================================
CONTROL — the same test on series with NO temporal structure
==============================================================================
A percentile is a claim about timing. On a shuffled-return series
there is nothing to time, so the same instrument must report ~50.
If it does not, the reading above is an artefact of the instrument
and cannot be reported as skill. This control runs unconditionally,
because a control you have to remember to run is a control that
gets skipped exactly when the result is exciting.

